{
 "about": [
  "Resident-token manifests: the files a Claude Code controller loads on each route, by phase.",
  "Paths are the head's. A path listed under aliases is read at the named revision from its older path (a file renamed between the counted points, counted under its role). A path absent at a revision counts as absent: before compaction-fit the moved step bodies were part of their SKILL.md, and are counted there.",
  "Each file is listed once per route, under the phase that first loads it; compaction and re-reads are not modelled.",
  "An entry with 'only' is loaded only when its condition arises; the figures give the every-run total and the total with those entries added.",
  "Load forms: hooks/session-start stands for the text the SessionStart hook emits (its fixed opening line, the router file whole, a separator, the host map); a SKILL.md is its body after the frontmatter, as the Skill tool loads it, less the header line naming its install path; any other file is its whole text, as a read loads it.",
  "Not listed: skills off every route's main line (systematic-debugging, receiving-review, dispatching-parallel-agents, writing-skills), seat templates (seats read them, the controller fills the card), and the controller's own records, the spec, the plan and the code.",
  "Workspace copy for prose-compaction: entries may carry was {rev: path} (the path holding the role at that rev); a path absent at a rev counts as absent. At 0deefcf the moved texts (round-record.md in formats.md, premise-asks.md in flip-paths.md, umbrella-children.md in umbrellas.md, git-fallback.md in using-git-worktrees/SKILL.md) are counted in their old homes."
 ],
